stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> pending: lawyer review or finalization notice
  pending --> previewed: public demo / preview mode
  pending --> canceled: packet invalidated
  pending --> failed: live delivery not authorized or configured
  pending --> sending: private delivery; claim lease
  sending --> sent: provider accepts
  sending --> failed: definitive rejection
  sending --> unknown_delivery: timeout or expired lease
  failed --> pending: explicit retry within delivery budget
  sent --> delivered: signed provider webhook
  sent --> bounced: signed provider webhook
  sent --> failed: signed provider webhook
  note right of previewed
    Current public deployment stops here.
    No email is sent. No approval is granted.
  end note
  note right of unknown_delivery
    Retry blocked until provider outcome is reconciled.
    Webhooks are retained and matched by provider ID.
  end note
